#
#
#
#
#   A shape can use if/then/else on n, like the "hollow"
#   shape in lesson 5's TRY THIS section.
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#   Give n == 3 a big volume, and everything else a smaller
#   one. Don't make the others zero, or the fundamental
#   disappears.
